        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-de97cc1c",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "If necessary, Ada Tours may replace the listed hotels with others in the same category."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:note:7097c9cfacb951d3",
      "field": "note",
      "sourceTextSha256": "8b7d20d191a108ae5c1b72754af2ad144999f700c6a6b55371f557c3b3317fe5",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-de97cc1c",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Ada Tours may change the order of the excursions while keeping all activities in the itinerary."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:note:97e52e6fdb8c6ac4",
      "field": "note",
      "sourceTextSha256": "4201f701902b5dedf1b3756a1fbfaafab623ae356a06f5ced31f29d0ca1d0e9b",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-de97cc1c",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "If you need to check out early for a flight or an excursion, you may miss breakfast at the hotel. Ada Tours does not provide compensation for a missed breakfast."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_title:5cd7a3d146d31311",
